cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these datasets in research, please cite this repository. All data is CC0; citation is appreciated, not required."
title: "ByKaranteli Crypto Datasets"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "ByKaranteli"
    website: "https://bykaranteli.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bykarantelicom/crypto-datasets"
url: "https://bykaranteli.com/data"
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  Daily-updated, CC0-licensed crypto market datasets collected by ByKaranteli's
  own recording network: real multi-venue liquidations, US spot ETF flows, CFTC
  COT positioning, Coinbase premium, DVOL, options open interest and tape
  rollups, execution-cost ladders, exchange insurance funds, macro liquidity
  series and a daily quantum-exposure measurement from a first-party Bitcoin
  Core node. Quarterly frozen releases are tagged for reproducible citation.
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - bitcoin
  - liquidations
  - derivatives
  - market-data
  - open-data
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22049575
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22049575
    description: Concept DOI, resolves to the latest frozen release
